{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "IFZGBMV3WESB7IUQL2QJX2IB7DDSCVTS",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041141005",
    "title": "運命の声と踊れ！",
    "enTitle": "Dance with the Voice of Fate!",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "エピファネイアと契約を結んでから、そこそこの日数が経過した。\n彼女に置いていかれがちだった関係も、変わってきている。",
            "enText": "Some time had passed since I had formally signed a \ncontract with Epiphaneia. What had started as me being \nbarely able to keep up with her, had started changing.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 120,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（初めは、本当にめちゃくちゃだったな）",
                    "enText": "(In the beginning it was crazy)",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7832631056023567628,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "新メニュー？　それよりシャトルランだ！\n今はこれが一番効果的だって、運命の声も言ってる！",
            "enText": "New menu? Instead of that, some Shuttle Runs! Right now, that'll \nbe the most effective, is what the Voice of Fate is saying!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 267,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 180,
                    "pathId": 8810341757284057008
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 16,
                    "pathId": -12826328488096468
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1088286269253928768,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "どりゃあああああああっ！！！！",
            "enText": "Doryaaaaaaaa!!!!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 100,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 80,
                    "pathId": 1725040120984843824
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2424582286760830192,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ミーティング？\nああ、もちろんいいぞ！　すぐやろう――",
            "enText": "A meeting? \nYeah, of course that's fine! We can start soon――",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 160,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 14,
                    "pathId": 4587051088008845430
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": 2159146192266225285
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": 5295693338487818216
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1018736329535714614,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "いや、やっぱりなしだ！\nあっちの子に伝えたいことができた！",
            "enText": "No, wait, nevermind that! \nThere's something I want to tell that girl!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 179,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ええっ！？エピ！？",
                    "enText": "Eeeh!? Epi!?",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 2075677145796365588
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -280411100944271479
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6779374072746287978,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "キミの時間をアタシにくれないか！？\n『運命の声』を授けたいんだ！",
            "enText": "Will you give me just a moment of your time!? \nI want to give you the 『Voice of Fate』!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 162,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 602811588681736031,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "――レーナー……トレーナー！！",
            "enText": "――rainer……Trainer!!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 85,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 148,
                    "pathId": -1661546275584326416
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 155,
                    "pathId": -3740877908270178331
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7225958259453891520,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ぼーっとして、どうしたんだ？\nアタシが来たのにも気づかなかったし――",
            "enText": "You're spacing out, what's wrong? \nYou didn't even notice when I got here――",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 159,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "契約したての頃を思い出していて……用事？",
                    "enText": "Just……something from back then",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 177,
                    "pathId": 7333750523710538438
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5893479946809252930
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2382691839182876419,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ああ！　外へ走りにいこう！\n試したいことがあるんだ！",
            "enText": "Okay! Let's run outside! \nThere's something I want to try!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 139,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 54,
                    "pathId": 239689489861389918
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1713028847583555693,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "今がいいって運命の声も言っている！\nさあ行こう！　すぐ行こう！　早く行こう！",
            "enText": "Right now is the time is what the Voice of Fate is saying! \nSo let's go! Right now! Quickly!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 194,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "わ、わかった！用意するから待って……！",
                    "enText": "O-okay! Wait for me……!",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": 2708632316101078704
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 3118127403799101293
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3606065973243502770,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "じゃあ、そこの人力車に乗ってくれ！",
            "enText": "So, get on that rickshaw!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 97,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……なんて？",
                    "enText": "……What?",
                    "nextBlock": 12
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 181,
                    "pathId": 7150504696791604997
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 170,
                    "pathId": -2340975803658686944
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 5687081328290457911
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6501759210659333582,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "一種の負荷トレーニングだよ！\nアタシがトレーナーを乗せて走るんだ！",
            "enText": "It's a kind of resistance training! \nI'll run while pulling this with Trainer in it!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 155,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": -5284356082543236527
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 4456965626766720801
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3239166997273824736,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "体幹も鍛えられるし、これならキミを置いていくこともないだろ？",
            "enText": "I can work on my core and, this way, \nI won't have to leave you behind, right?",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 147,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 92,
                    "pathId": 4361988662230814888
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3616844995726675426,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "エピファネイアに言われ、\n以前、自転車で併走していた際に置いていかれたことを思い出す。",
            "enText": "At Epiphaneia's words, I recall that before, \nI was left behind even riding a bike beside her.",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ……あの時は焦ったなぁ",
                    "enText": "Yeah……I really panicked back then",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 119,
                    "pathId": -6004236515689902937
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8720834218947613873,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ははっ、悪かったって！　ほら、早く試してみよう！",
            "enText": "Haha, I said I was sorry! C'mon, quickly, let's try this out!",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 150,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 157,
                    "pathId": 7068261208091640671
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6070443553207836330,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ふぅ、いい汗かいたな！\n……おっと、腹の虫も騒ぎ始めた！",
            "enText": "Phew, I worked up a good sweat, huh! \n……Oh, seems like my stomach's started rumbling!",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 250,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "帰りに何か食べていこうか？",
                    "enText": "Should we stop and get some food?",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3322370009913013703
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 101,
                    "pathId": -3761585998562082449
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1790218546441100676,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "賛成だ！　……あ、行くなら商店街のラーメン屋がいいな。\n完食チャレンジがしたい！　運命の声も、そうしろって言ってる！",
            "enText": "Agreed! ……Ah, I'd like to try that ramen shop in \nthe shopping district. I want to try that Eating \nChallenge! The Voice of Fate is telling me I should too!",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 335,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 67,
                    "pathId": -5607647281742396377
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7034334712167703098
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2116918423894382912,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ほら、キミの分も来たぞ！　大盛ラーメン・人間版！",
            "enText": "Look, yours is here too! Extra-Large Ramen: Human Version!",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 181,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "うわ、結構多いな……！",
                    "enText": "Uwah, there's so much……!",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うわ、結構多いね……！",
                    "enText": "Uwah, there's so much……!",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 277,
                    "pathId": 6321203747598980476
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5171175542022388582
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2502920952642741342,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "先ほど運ばれてきたウマ娘用のラーメンよりは少ないが、\nそれでも気圧されるボリュームだ。",
            "enText": "It was less ramen than the Uma Musume-sized portion \nbrought out earlier, but it still had quite the volume.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 131,
                    "pathId": 7795858249242692147
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 6599550654507717890
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1327235774388284648,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "大丈夫だ！　トレーナーは根性がある。そしてなにより、\nアタシが一緒にできるって言ってる！　さあ、お互い頑張ろう！",
            "enText": "It's fine! Trainer, you have guts. And more than that, I'm \nsaying that we can do it together! Now, let's both do our best!",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 342,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そうだな……やってみる！",
                    "enText": "Right……let's give it a try!",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "そうだね……やってみる！",
                    "enText": "Right……let's give it a try!",
                    "nextBlock": 21
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 3642073578206965852
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -5517684282501355863
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3985271697649268603,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "完食チャレンジ、大成功ーーーーっ！！\nな！　大丈夫だっただろ、トレーナー！！",
            "enText": "Food Challenge, a huge successーーーー!! \nRight!? It was fine, wasn't it, Trainer!?",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 247,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ！エピの勢いに影響されたのかも",
                    "enText": "Epi's momentum may have helped me",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん！エピの勢いに影響されたのかも",
                    "enText": "Epi's momentum may have helped me",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": 204725104606654685
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 3788750224227101806
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2243579894062558556,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "あははっ、ラーメンは一気に吸い込めるから食べやすくて好きだ！\nでもキミも、ラストスパート、かっこよかったぞ！",
            "enText": "Ahaha, ramen is easy to finish in one go, so I like it! \nBut, you too, your last spurt was cool too!",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 306,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ははっ、そうか？ありがとう",
                    "enText": "Haha, it was? Thanks",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "ふふっ、そう？ありがとう",
                    "enText": "Fufu, it was? Thanks",
                    "nextBlock": 23
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 175,
                    "pathId": -2696542488142383703
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -3341227695058136829
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1114597125351701320,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "達成感が心を満たす。\n……と同時に、満腹感も改めて湧き上がってきた。",
            "enText": "A sense of accomplishment swept over me. \n……as well as a sense of fulfillment.",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 89,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "少し休まないか？……お腹が張っちゃってさ",
                    "enText": "Let's take a break……too full",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "少し休まない？……お腹が張っちゃってさ",
                    "enText": "Let's take a break……too full",
                    "nextBlock": 24
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 120,
                    "pathId": -2272127181813456729
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -459788967576358207,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "そうなのか？　なら、休むよりいい方法があるぞ。\n食後の運動だ！　一緒に歌おう！",
            "enText": "Is that so? Then, I've got a better idea than resting. \nSome post-meal exercise! Let's sing together!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 282,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "歌！？ここで！？",
                    "enText": "Sing!? Here!?",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 137,
                    "pathId": -2345109686683345723
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8963763278802037109,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ああ！　ちょうどステージもあるしさ！\nアタシのソロ曲、全部覚えてるだろ？　ほらほら！",
            "enText": "Yeah! There's even a stage right here! \nMy solo song, you've already memorized it, right? C'mon, c'mon!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 252,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "そりゃ覚えてるけど……！",
                    "enText": "Well, yeah I memorized it, but……!",
                    "nextBlock": 26
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -3592405277877529180
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 5738054089752885451
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9215875882648009100,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "ここにはアタシたちだけだ！　思いっきり歌おう！\n運命の声も、やってみろってさ！",
            "enText": "We're the only ones here! Sing your heart out! \nEven the Voice of Fate is saying you should give it a try!",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 216,
            "voiceIdx": 21,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 124,
                    "pathId": 4663122916737587225
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4047415969505930134,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――勧められるままに歌ってみると、存外気持ちよかった。\n心から楽しげな彼女が隣にいることも大きいのかもしれない。",
            "enText": "――Just like she said, when I sang, it felt surprisingly \ngood. Part of it might have been because she was there \nwith me and seemed to be genuinely enjoying it.",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 118,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 1522281966278828382
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7340636867134222776,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "な、よかっただろ？\nトレーナーも途中からノリノリだったじゃないか！",
            "enText": "See, it was great, right? \nTrainer, even you were starting to get really in to it!",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 171,
            "voiceIdx": 22,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ……すごくスカッとした！",
                    "enText": "Yeah……I'm feeling better now!",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん……すごくスカッとした！",
                    "enText": "Yeah……I'm feeling better now!",
                    "nextBlock": 29
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 157,
                    "pathId": 2777760567813277254
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 385297535926940356,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "エピファネイア",
            "enName": "Epiphaneia",
            "jpText": "よしよし！　じゃあ、そろそろ帰ろう！\n全力で歌ったおかげで、夜もぐっすり眠れそうだ！",
            "enText": "Good good! Then, let's start heading back! After singing your \nheart out like that, you should be able to get a good night sleep!",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 266,
            "voiceIdx": 23,
            "animData": [
                {
